{"text": "The Wind.\n\nToday, Ravi's red kite flies over the town.\n\nRavi is nine. He lives in a town by the sea. His home is on a hill. It has a small balcony with flowers.\n\nRavi and his dad make the kite. It is red and yellow.\n\nMum is on the balcony. \"Lunch is at twelve, Ravi!\"\n\n\"OK, Mum!\"\n\nIt is Sunday morning. The wind is very strong. Ravi runs to the park.\n\nWhere does the kite go today?\n\nThe park is on top of the hill. There are tall trees and green grass.\n\nRavi holds his kite. It goes up, up, up. It dances in the blue sky.\n\n\"Look at my kite!\" says Ravi.\n\nThen the wind is very strong. Ravi's hand opens. The kite flies away!\n\n\"Stop!\" says Ravi. But a kite can't hear.\n\nIt flies over the trees. It goes down the hill. Ravi runs after it.\n\nRavi runs into the market. There are apples, oranges and bananas.\n\nMr Das sells fruit here. He has a big white hat. He knows Ravi.\n\n\"Mr Das! My kite! Can you see it?\"\n\nMr Das looks up. \"It goes to the river.\"\n\n\"Oh no! The river is very far.\"\n\nMr Das smiles. He gives Ravi an orange. \"Don't be sad. The wind turns at twelve.\"\n\nRavi does not know this. But he says thank you. Then he runs on.\n\nNow Ravi is on a long street. Cars and bikes go up and down.\n\nAn old yellow tram comes down the street. It is very slow.\n\nRavi looks up. Where is his kite?\n\nThen he sees something red. It is on top of the tram!\n\nIt goes down the street. It does not stop.", "textSha256": "5f7ae907388f0f9fb62bad8c59ebc6ad4d5a545638b3a79a469774ce72784ff0", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "W", "i", "n", "d", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "o", "d", "a", "y", ",", " ", "R", "a", "v", "i", "'", "s", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "k", "i", "t", "e", " ", "f", "l", "i", "e", "s", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "o", "w", "n", ".", "\n", "\n", "R", "a", "v", "i", " ", "i", "s", " ", "n